{
 "encounter_id": "00558",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning. Mr. Kowalczyk? Did I get that right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Close enough, it's Ko-VAL-chick. But the grandkids call me Pop-Pop, so call me Gene, whatever's easiest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Gene it is. And I see you've brought someone with you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm Tanya, one of the carers at Maplewood. I've looked after Gene for about two years now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Welcome, Tanya. Gene, what brings you in today?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "This wheezing, doctor. It's mostly at night, and again first thing in the morning. Sounds like a squeaky gate."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can hear it from the hall. Around four, usually. I look in and he's sitting up on the edge of the bed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That must be wearing on both of you. How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six weeks. It started around the time the lawn crew did their last cut of the season. Funny what you remember."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anything bring it on, or ease it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold air makes it worse. Sitting up on two pillows helps, and a warm shower."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about during the day? Any shortness of breath?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "On the stairs, yes. I get puffed halfway up to the second floor. I used to take them in one go carrying a laundry basket."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you cough at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A dry cough, a little tickle, mostly when I lie down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Now I'm going to ask about a few things you may not have. Any fever, chest pain, swelling in your legs, or coughing up blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none of those. Thank goodness. My buddy Walt had a chest scare last spring and it frightened us all half to death."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm glad you're clear of those. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lisinopril, 10 milligrams once a day. Metformin, 500 milligrams twice a day. Tanya, what's the third one?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Atorvastatin, 20 milligrams at bedtime. I do the pill cups."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. Now, do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Shellfish. I'm allergic to shellfish, it gives me hives. I found that out at my niece's wedding, after the shrimp cocktail. She still brings it up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hives from shellfish, noted. Are there any other health conditions I should have on the list?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, type 2 diabetes, and high cholesterol. That's the holy trinity at my age."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Knee replacement in 2015, and my gallbladder came out about eight years ago. The knee's a champ."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to hear. Does any lung trouble run in your family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had asthma. She kept an old inhaler in every coat pocket."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Interesting. Have you ever smoked, Gene?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A pack a day for years. I smoked until about twenty years ago, then my wife made me quit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good for her. And where do you live these days?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live at Maplewood, the care home, third floor. Best part is the bingo on Thursdays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ha, I hope you win. Any problems with your stomach or bowels?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, regular as clockwork."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Let me check your numbers now, and then listen to your chest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 138 over 84. Pulse 82. Breathing 18 breaths a minute.",
   "pause": 14
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Temperature 36.8, and oxygen saturation 95 per cent."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's acceptable, a little on the low side of comfortable. Lean forward and breathe in and out through your mouth for me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? I did this at the clinic back home too, with a different doctor who had cold hands.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Just like that. I can hear a wheeze when you breathe out, on both sides, and your heart sounds are normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's the squeak I hear at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what is it, doctor? Be honest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't rule out asthma yet, even though it's late for it to start. With your smoking years I can't rule out COPD either. I'd rather test than guess."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well, test away. My mother would say better the devil you know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then let's start with a breathing test called spirometry, here in the clinic, this week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like a chest X-ray, to look at the lungs and heart."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need to take my shirt off for that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Just the gown. I'd like some blood tests as well, to check for infection and your sugar levels."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And we'll do an ECG, a quick heart tracing, before you leave today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sounds like a spa day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not quite, but near enough. In the meantime, Tanya, could you keep a note of when he wheezes at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Of course. I'll write it in his chart every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. I'd like to see you both again in two weeks, once the results are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. I'll miss bingo, no, that's Thursday. I'm fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then Thursday's safe. Anything else you want to ask before you go?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Only whether the shrimp thing is going to matter for any of this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, that's separate. Just keep avoiding it, Gene."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I always do. Thank you, doctor."
  }
 ],
